# Local redactions for the agent session log -- TEMPLATE, copy to
# `.agentlog-redactions` and fill in with YOUR values.
#
# This file (`.agentlog-redactions`) is intentionally gitignored: the repo
# ships the redaction mechanism and this example, never a personal map.
#
# Format: one rule per line,  REGEX :: REPLACEMENT
#   * rules apply in order, to every rendered artifact (.md, .jsonl, index)
#   * '#' lines are comments; blank lines are ignored
#   * rules are idempotent, so re-running is always safe
#
# Typical personal values worth mapping away before a public repo:
#
# /home/<yourname> :: ~
# <Your Name> :: <author>
# <you>@<your.domain> :: <email>
# <hostname> :: <host>
# <other-private-project-words> :: <private-project>
#
# Related knobs (environment, handled by the exporter):
#   AGENTLOG_HIDE_USAGE=1   default: token/cost stats hidden from the log
#   AGENTLOG_MD_MAX=3000    cap per fenced block in the .md rendition
#
# After changing the map:  scripts/export-agent-log
